READING: freedom_i = floor(M/F_i) = # settable residues mod q* for runner i.
If freedom_i < q* the runner CANNOT hit an arbitrary residue mod q* (its residue is
partly forced). #forced/13 near 13 => the adversary has ~no room to ALIGN the danger
sets at q* => residues generic => witness (f_q->0). This is `alignment costs magnitude`
at the residue level: max divisibility (heavy F_i) leaves no cofactor room to cover q*.
